<h1>James Joyce Letters — Sveltia/Eleventy POC</h1>
<p>
  A proof-of-concept conversion of a sample of TEI-encoded letters from the
  <a href="https://joyceletters.uantwerpen.be/">University of Antwerp James Joyce correspondence edition</a>
  into Markdown + YAML frontmatter, editable via Sveltia CMS and built with Eleventy.
  Search is powered by Pagefind (run <code>npm run build:search</code> then serve <code>_site/</code>).
</p>
<ul class="entry-list">
{% for letter in collections.letters %}
  <li><a href="{{ letter.url }}">{{ letter.data.title }}</a> — {{ letter.data.correspondence.date }}</li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>
<p>See also: <a href="/letters/">all letters</a>, <a href="/people/">people</a>, <a href="/places/">places</a>, <a href="/works/">works</a>.</p>
